        <mxCell id="RdmEUeUCx2XvI4Xg6RIF-2" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=10;" value="As of August 3, 2024, what is the hometown of the captain of the team that won the Stanley Cup three years before 2017?" vertex="1">
