        <mxCell id="RdmEUeUCx2XvI4Xg6RIF-11" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;html=1;strokeColor=none;textShadow=0;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 0, 77);&quot;&gt;1. What year is three years before 2017?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Which team won the Stanley Cup in that year?&lt;br&gt;3. Who is the captain of that team?&lt;br&gt;4. What is the hometown of that captain?" vertex="1">
