        <mxCell id="RdmEUeUCx2XvI4Xg6RIF-13" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=10;" value="Imagine there is a building called Bronte tower whose height in feet is the same number as the dewey decimal classification for the Charlotte Bronte book that was published in 1847. Where would this building rank among tallest buildings in New York City, as of August 2024?" vertex="1">
