        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RdmEUeUCx2XvI4Xg6RIF-14" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=2;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;html=1;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 0, 77);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 0, 77);&quot;&gt;1. What is the Dewey Decimal classification for the Charlotte Bronte book published in 1847?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. What is the height of the Bronte Tower in feet, based on the Dewey Decimal classification from the previous question?&lt;br&gt;3. What is the list of the tallest buildings in New York City as of August 2024?&lt;br&gt;4. How does the height of the Bronte Tower compare to the heights of the tallest buildings in New York City as of August 2024?" vertex="1">
